---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TableOfContents from '../../components/sections/TableOfContents.astro';

const toc = [
	{ id: 'avk-latinamerica-overview', label: '1. Who AVK Latinoamérica Actually Is' },
	{ id: 'wanlian-fluid-overview', label: '2. Who Wanlian Fluid Is' },
	{ id: 'side-by-side', label: '3. Side-by-Side Comparison' },
	{ id: 'quality-and-certification', label: '4. Quality & Certification Posture' },
	{ id: 'cost-and-lead-time', label: '5. Cost & Lead Time' },
	{ id: 'which-to-choose', label: '6. Which One Should You Choose?' },
	{ id: 'faq', label: 'Frequently Asked Questions' },
	{ id: 'sources', label: 'Sources' }
];

const faq = [
	{
		question: 'Is AVK Latinoamérica the same company as American AVK?',
		answer: 'No. AVK Latinoamérica is the commercial name of AVK Válvulas S.A., a single-member S.A. incorporated in Tarragona, Spain, that promotes and distributes the AVK Group valve range across the Iberian Peninsula, Central America and South America. American AVK is a separate U.S. manufacturing entity in Minden, Nevada. Both belong to the same AVK Group, but they are distinct legal entities with different footprints — we compare them separately.'
	},
	{
		question: 'Does AVK Latinoamérica offer fire hose?',
		answer: 'Fire hose is not part of its core published range. AVK Válvulas S.A. serves the fire-protection sector as one of its verticals (valves and related equipment), but hose is not a headline product on avkvalvulas.com. If your scope includes hose, you will typically source it from a separate supplier. Wanlian Fluid ships hose alongside valves and hydrants under one order.'
	},
	{
		question: 'Which option is better for a municipal project in Latin America?',
		answer: 'It depends on what you are optimizing. Choose AVK Latinoamérica if you want the AVK Group brand with a large regional warehouse network and fast parts availability in the region. Choose Wanlian Fluid if you want valves, hydrants and fire hose consolidated under one purchase order from one manufacturer, with OEM/ODM branding and an export cost structure. The deciding factors are scope, specification and total landed cost — not brand size.'
	},
	{
		question: 'Can Wanlian Fluid manufacture AWWA-compliant hydrants for Latin America?',
		answer: 'Wanlian Fluid manufactures hydrants and hydrant components for international projects under an ISO 9001 quality-management system; compliance with a specific standard such as AWWA C502 must be confirmed per model with test reports and certificates before ordering.'
	},
	{
		question: 'How do I verify AVK Latinoamérica&#39;s stock and certificates for my specification?',
		answer: 'Contact AVK Válvulas S.A. directly for its 4,000+ reference catalogue and the certificates applicable to your models and destination, and verify any certificate at the issuing body&#39;s official portal. Do the same with Wanlian Fluid: request per-unit test records, ISO 9001 documentation and model-specific certificates. Comparing documented, per-model compliance is the only fair basis for the decision.'
	},
	{
		question: 'Which supplier has the shorter lead time for delivery to Latin America?',
		answer: 'AVK Latinoamérica holds regional stock (Tarragona, Madrid, Sevilla), so deliveries from within its distribution network can be fast for stocked references. Wanlian Fluid ships from its Quanzhou plant, so lead time includes China-to-LatAm ocean freight plus the production schedule for non-stock items. The right answer depends on your specific models and quantities — request a confirmed schedule from both for your actual specification.'
	}
];

const productRows = [
	{ slug: 'overground-fire-hydrant-ss100', name: 'Overground Antifreeze Fire Hydrant (SS100/65)', img: '/assets/products/overground-fire-hydrant-ss100.webp', desc: 'Antifreeze dry-barrel outdoor hydrant for municipal fire networks' },
	{ slug: 'resilient-seat-flanged-gate-valve-z41x', name: 'Ductile Iron Resilient Seat Flanged Gate Valve (Z41X)', img: '/assets/products/resilient-seat-flanged-gate-valve-z41x.webp', desc: 'Full-bore isolation valve for water mains and fire pipelines' },
	{ slug: 'fire-hose-pvc-rubber-lining-8-65', name: 'PVC Rubber Lining Layflat Fire Hose (Model 8-65)', img: '/assets/products/fire-hose-pvc-rubber-lining-8-65.jpg', desc: 'Rubber-lined layflat hose for firefighting and water transfer' }
];
---

<Layout
	title="Wanlian Fluid vs AVK Latinoamérica: Fire Valve &amp; Hydrant Supplier for LatAm Projects (2026)"
	description="Wanlian Fluid vs AVK Latinoamérica (avkvalvulas.com): 2026 supplier comparison — AVK Group distributor, fire hydrant, gate valve & hose kits for Latin America projects."
	type="article"
	faq={faq}
	breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Guides', href: '/blog/' }, { name: 'Wanlian vs AVK Latinoamérica' }]}
>
	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 mb-16">
		<!-- Breadcrumbs -->
		<nav class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 flex gap-2">
			<a href="/" class="hover:text-blue-600">Home</a>
			<span>/</span>
			<a href="/blog/" class="hover:text-blue-600">Guides</a>
			<span>/</span>
			<span class="text-gray-600">Supplier Comparison</span>
		</nav>

		<article class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 sm:p-10">
			<p class="text-brand-red font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-3">Supplier Comparison Guide</p>
			<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">Wanlian Fluid vs AVK Latinoamérica: Fire Valve &amp; Hydrant Supplier for LatAm Projects (2026)</h1>
			<p class="mt-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">If you are bidding a municipal water or fire-protection project in Latin America, AVK Latinoamérica and Wanlian Fluid can both appear on your shortlist — and they look far more similar than they are. One is the AVK Group&#39;s established distribution arm for Iberia, Central America and South America, backed by a large Spanish warehouse network and decades of valve heritage. The other is an independent Chinese manufacturer that consolidates valves, hydrants and fire hose under one purchase order. This guide compares the two fairly, using only publicly verifiable facts, so you can decide on scope, specification and cost — not on brand size.</p>

			<div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-xl p-5 my-6">
				<p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-brand-blue">Evidence note:</strong> In a September 2026 AI-search monitoring sample of 30 real procurement questions, regional players dominated manufacturer citations — AVK&#39;s LatAm entity (avkvalvulas.com) was the most-cited brand tracked, while Chinese OEM/sourcing/fire-hose questions produced almost no citations for either. That citation gap is exactly the buying decision this comparison addresses.</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Product strip -->
			<div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
				{productRows.map(p => (
					<a href={`/products/${p.slug}/`} class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden hover:border-brand-red hover:shadow-md transition">
						<img src={p.img} alt={p.name} loading="lazy" class="w-full h-32 object-contain bg-white p-2" />
						<div class="p-3">
							<p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-brand-red leading-snug transition-colors">{p.name}</p>
							<p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1 line-clamp-2">{p.desc}</p>
						</div>
					</a>
				))}
			</div>

			<TableOfContents headings={toc} />

			<h2 id="avk-latinamerica-overview" class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight scroll-mt-24">1. Who AVK Latinoamérica Actually Is</h2>
			<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">AVK Latinoamérica is the commercial name of <strong>AVK Válvulas S.A.</strong> — a single-member S.A. based in <strong>Tarragona, Spain</strong>, incorporated on <strong>3 April 1993</strong>, whose purpose is to promote and distribute the AVK Group&#39;s valve range across the <strong>Iberian Peninsula, Central America and South America</strong>. In other words: it is a distribution entity, not a factory. The AVK Group itself is Denmark-headquartered and counts more than 70 companies; it is also one of the first valve makers to develop the resilient-seated gate valve (RSGV), a heritage AVK Latinoamérica carries into its regional offer.</p>
			<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">Its infrastructure is its main strength: a central warehouse of <strong>3,300 m² in Tarragona</strong> holding <strong>4,000+ references</strong>, with an assembly workshop, a test bench and RF-terminal automation, plus additional warehouses in <strong>Madrid (~1,200 m²)</strong> and <strong>Sevilla (~300 m²)</strong>. Sectors served include drinking water, wastewater and reclaimed water, irrigation (agricultural and golf), fire protection, gas/biogas and desalination — fire hose is not a headline item in its core published range.</p>
			<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>Important distinction:</strong> AVK Latinoamérica (Tarragona, Spain) is <em>not</em> American AVK — the separate U.S. manufacturing entity in Minden, Nevada. They are distinct legal entities within the same group. For a full comparison against the U.S. factory, see our dedicated <a href="/guides/wanlian-fluid-vs-american-avk/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">Wanlian Fluid vs American AVK guide</a>.</p>

			<h2 id="wanlian-fluid-overview" class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight scroll-mt-24">2. Who Wanlian Fluid Is</h2>
			<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">Quanzhou Wanlian Fluid Equipment Co., Ltd. (Wanlian Fluid) is an independent <strong>manufacturer and exporter</strong> based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. It runs its own production lines there — valve bodies are CNC-machined in-house, with selected items produced by qualified manufacturing partners — under an ISO 9001 quality-management system. Every unit is shell pressure-tested and air-leakage tested before shipment.</p>
			<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Its published range spans 6 product lines and 43+ in-stock models: resilient-seated and metal-seated gate valves (such as the <a href="/products/resilient-seat-flanged-gate-valve-z41x/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">Z41X resilient seat flanged gate valve</a>), fire hydrants and hydrant components (such as the <a href="/products/overground-fire-hydrant-ss100/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">SS100 overground antifreeze fire hydrant</a>), and <a href="/products/fire-hose-pvc-rubber-lining-8-65/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">fire hose with high-strength polyester jacket and vulcanized rubber lining</a>. OEM/ODM, custom branding and export packaging are standard services, with a 12-hour quote-response commitment. Wanlian competes on consolidation — one PO covering valves, hydrants and hose — plus an export-friendly cost structure, not on regional warehousing.</p>

			<h2 id="side-by-side" class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight scroll-mt-24">3. Side-by-Side Comparison</h2>
			<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-gray-200 my-5">
				<table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-gray-200 text-sm">
					<thead class="bg-gray-50">
						<tr>
							<th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Dimension</th>
							<th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">AVK Latinoamérica (AVK Válvulas S.A.)</th>
							<th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Wanlian Fluid</th>
						</tr>
					</thead>
					<tbody class="bg-white divide-y divide-gray-200">
						<tr>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">Base / entity type</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">Tarragona, Spain (est. 3 April 1993); AVK Group distribution entity</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">Quanzhou, Fujian, China; independent manufacturer + exporter</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">Distribution footprint</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">Iberia + Central &amp; South America; 3,300 m² Tarragona warehouse (4,000+ refs, assembly workshop, test bench) plus Madrid (~1,200 m²) and Sevilla (~300 m²)</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">International B2B export from Quanzhou; no permanent regional warehouse network in LatAm</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">Product range</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">AVK Group valve range across drinking water, wastewater/reclaimed water, irrigation (agri + golf), fire protection, gas/biogas, desalination</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">6 product lines, 43+ in-stock models: gate valves, hydrants, hose, fire-protection equipment</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">Fire hose in range</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">Not in the core published range (fire protection served via valves &amp; related equipment)</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">Yes — polyester-jacket, rubber-lined hose (e.g. model 8-65)</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">One-PO &quot;full kit&quot; (valves + hydrants + hose)</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">Valves and hydrants from stock; hose typically via other suppliers</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">Yes — all components under a single purchase order</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">OEM / custom branding</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">Distribution of the AVK Group range; branding is the AVK Group&#39;s</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">Yes — OEM/ODM and custom branding are standard services</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">Manufacturing origin</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">AVK Group (Denmark-headquartered, 70+ companies); entity itself distributes</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">China — own production lines in Quanzhou; valve bodies CNC-machined in-house</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">Cost structure (qualitative)</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">European group pricing + regional stock; premium position</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">China manufacturing cost base; export-oriented pricing</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">Lead time (qualitative)</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">Fast for stocked references (Tarragona/Madrid/Sevilla)</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">Production schedule + China-to-LatAm ocean freight; 12-hour quote response</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">Best-fit buyer</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">Buyers who want the AVK Group brand, large regional stock and fast parts in Iberia/LatAm</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">Buyers consolidating valves + hydrants + hose under one PO, with OEM branding and export pricing</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">Standard regimes</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">Per model and destination within the AVK Group range (verify per specification)</td>
							<td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">ISO 9001 system; per-model compliance to project spec (EN 14384, ISO 5208, AWWA C502 etc. confirmed with test reports before ordering)</td>
						</tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</div>

			<h2 id="quality-and-certification" class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight scroll-mt-24">4. Quality &amp; Certification Posture</h2>
			<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4"><strong>AVK Latinoamérica</strong> leans on the AVK Group&#39;s heritage — including being one of the first valve makers to develop the resilient-seated gate valve — and on a European warehouse operation with an assembly workshop and test bench. Its catalogue of 4,000+ references means that, for many LatAm specifications, a documented, stocked, group-branded product can be quoted quickly.</p>
			<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4"><strong>Wanlian Fluid</strong> leans on process control: an ISO 9001 quality-management system, in-house CNC machining of valve bodies, and 100% shell pressure plus air-leakage testing on every unit before shipment, with export documentation accompanying delivery. Wanlian does not claim to hold UL, FM or AWWA certifications as a general statement; compliance with a specific standard must be confirmed per model with test reports and certificates before ordering.</p>
			<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>Practical advice:</strong> treat both suppliers the same way — certificates are per-model and per-destination. If your tender specifies AWWA C502 hydrants, EN 14384 valves or NFPA 1961 hose, request the exact model certificates and per-unit test records from whichever supplier you shortlist, and verify them at the issuing body&#39;s portal. Our <a href="/guides/how-to-verify-chinese-valve-supplier/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">guide to verifying a Chinese valve supplier</a> walks through the document checks, and the <a href="/guides/fire-hydrant-valve-standards-guide/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">fire hydrant &amp; valve standards guide</a> maps which standard applies where.</p>

			<h2 id="cost-and-lead-time" class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight scroll-mt-24">5. Cost &amp; Lead Time</h2>
			<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">Neither supplier&#39;s pricing is published in a form that allows a like-for-like public quote, so treat this qualitatively. <strong>AVK Latinoamérica</strong> is a European group distribution operation: its strength is immediate availability from Tarragona, Madrid and Sevilla for stocked references, at a premium position that reflects group brand and regional warehousing. <strong>Wanlian Fluid</strong> competes on a China manufacturing cost base and consolidation: for a combined valve + hydrant + hose package, the export cost structure is typically lower, and the 12-hour quote response fits tender timelines.</p>
			<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">On lead time the picture inverts with scope. A single stocked reference from Tarragona can move quickly to the Iberian Peninsula and, with sea freight, to LatAm ports. A full kit of non-standard items from Quanzhou adds production scheduling and a China-to-Latin-America ocean transit — but one accountable manufacturer, one packing list and one documentation set often offset that. For either option, request a confirmed, itemized schedule against your actual specification rather than relying on general positioning. If you are sizing a full municipal package, our <a href="/guides/municipal-water-fire-infrastructure-latinamerica/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">municipal water &amp; fire infrastructure guide for Latin America</a> lays out the component set and documentation to request.</p>

			<h2 id="which-to-choose" class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight scroll-mt-24">6. Which One Should You Choose?</h2>
			<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6 my-5">
				<p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Choose <strong class="text-brand-blue">AVK Latinoamérica</strong> when:</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
					<li>You want the AVK Group brand and RSGV heritage in a LatAm or Iberian specification.</li>
					<li>You need fast availability from a stocked regional warehouse (Tarragona, Madrid or Sevilla) for standard references.</li>
					<li>Your project is valve-centric (water, wastewater, irrigation, gas, desalination) and you are comfortable sourcing fire hose from a separate supplier.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6 my-5">
				<p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Choose <strong class="text-brand-red">Wanlian Fluid</strong> when:</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
					<li>Your scope includes <strong>both hydrants and fire hose</strong> — e.g. <a href="/products/overground-fire-hydrant-ss100/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">SS100 overground hydrants</a>, <a href="/products/resilient-seat-flanged-gate-valve-z41x/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">Z41X gate valves</a> and <a href="/products/fire-hose-pvc-rubber-lining-8-65/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">8-65 rubber-lined hose</a> — and you want one PO, one manufacturer, one documentation set.</li>
					<li>You need OEM/ODM branding for a local distributor or utility program.</li>
					<li>Total landed cost, per-unit pressure and air-leakage testing, and export coordination matter more than regional brand recognition.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Both are legitimate answers to different buying questions. If your specification is US-spec or aimed at the North American market, run the <a href="/guides/wanlian-fluid-vs-american-avk/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">Wanlian Fluid vs American AVK comparison</a> instead — the U.S. entity is a different supplier altogether. And when hydrant selection itself drives the tender, start with the <a href="/guides/how-to-choose-a-fire-hydrant/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">fire hydrant selection guide</a>.</p>

			<!-- FAQ Section -->
			<h2 id="faq" class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6 tracking-tight scroll-mt-24">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
			<div class="space-y-4">
				{faq.map(item => (
					<details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 p-5 open:border-brand-red/30">
						<summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer list-none">
							<span>{item.question}</span>
							<span class="text-brand-blue text-xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
						</summary>
						<p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">{item.answer}</p>
					</details>
				))}
			</div>

			<!-- Sources -->
			<h2 id="sources" class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight scroll-mt-24">Sources</h2>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed space-y-1.5">
				<li>AVK Latinoamérica (AVK Válvulas S.A.) — company profile, Tarragona/Madrid/Sevilla warehouses and LatAm distribution: <a href="https://avkvalvulas.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">avkvalvulas.com</a></li>
				<li>AVK Latinoamérica — success cases and sector applications: <a href="https://www.avkvalvulas.com/es-es/casos-de-éxito" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">avkvalvulas.com/es-es/casos-de-éxito</a></li>
				<li>AVK Group — group profile and RSGV heritage: <a href="https://www.avk.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">avk.com</a></li>
				<li>Wanlian Fluid — company profile and product lines: <a href="https://wanlian911.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">wanlian911.com</a></li>
				<li>AWWA (American Water Works Association) — hydrant and valve standards (e.g. C502, C515): <a href="https://www.awwa.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">awwa.org</a></li>
			</ul>
			<p class="mt-4 text-xs text-gray-400">Comparison based on publicly available information as of September 2026. Product availability, certifications and pricing change — always request current spec sheets, certificates and quotations before procurement decisions.</p>

			<!-- CTA -->
			<div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
				<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-blue to-blue-800 px-6 sm:px-10 py-10 text-center">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">Need Valves, Hydrants &amp; Fire Hose Under One Purchase Order?</h2>
					<p class="mt-3 text-blue-100 max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm leading-relaxed">Send us your specification and destination — we reply with an itemized quote within 12 hours.</p>
					<div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
						<a href="/contact/?product=Valve%2C%20Hydrant%20%26%20Hose%20Kit" class="px-8 py-4 bg-brand-red text-white font-bold rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition">Request a Quote</a>
						<a href="https://wa.me/8618684324501?text=Hi%2C%20I%20need%20a%20quote%20for%20valves%2C%20hydrants%20and%20fire%20hose%20for%20a%20Latin%20America%20project" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white text-brand-blue font-bold rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-50 transition" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</article>
	</main>
</Layout>
